# way: r = atan(grip_limit * grip * gain / v^2). Code: all cars.
# DUSA rounds to its 1/256 atan step and falls back to a per-car minimum
# when that gives 0; CCE truncates at 1/512 and has no minimum.
#   rear  (060360AC): a per-tick rotation limit on the slide rate, x2/3 at 30 Hz
#   front (060361E4): an angle that sets yaw (+0x64); unchanged by tick rate
# Source: patches/rotation_atan.s (assembled by tools/sh2asm.py) into the
# dead function at 06032918; the calls' literals are pointed at it.
